#: ../../source/user-guides/data-pipeline.md:1 0693275f86c741abb33fbef0b480442a
msgid "数据处理管线"
msgstr "Data Processing Pipeline"

#: ../../source/user-guides/data-pipeline.md:3 b760f9ee67d843cb9541937d30cced09
msgid ""
"UniKT 提供了一套高吞吐、强类型、抗数据泄露的数据处理管线，通过统一入口 `data_process.py` "
"完成原始数据的下载、格式转换、特征工程与 K 折划分。"
msgstr ""
"UniKT provides a high-throughput, strongly typed, leak-free data "
"processing pipeline driving raw data downloading, ETL transformations, "
"feature engineering, and K-fold partitioning through `data_process.py`."

#: ../../source/user-guides/data-pipeline.md:7 300242a93b104b06bc99e18d4cbc4485
msgid "工作流与执行命令"
msgstr "Workflow and Execution Commands"

#: ../../source/user-guides/data-pipeline.md:9 691f225c400a422bba71398d9cc1937f
msgid "数据预处理分为两个主要阶段：**下载阶段 `download`** 与 **处理阶段 `process`**。完整的数据处理包含五个步骤："
msgstr ""
"Data preprocessing consists of two main stages: **downloading "
"(`download`)** and **processing (`process`)**. The complete workflow "
"encompasses five steps:"

#: ../../source/user-guides/data-pipeline.md:11
#: 195618c55663464989b26b679d272ae5
msgid ""
"**拉取原始数据**：通过 `data_process.py download` 从官方镜像或 CDN 下载原始压缩包，解压到 "
"`data/<dataset>/raw/`。"
msgstr ""
"**Pull Raw Data**: Download raw archives from official sources or CDN "
"mirrors via `data_process.py download`, extracting to "
"`data/<dataset>/raw/`."

#: ../../source/user-guides/data-pipeline.md:12
#: 323bdc15efe74396a663dd33ad82596e
msgid ""
"**清洗与 ID 映射**：通过 `data_process.py process` 使用 Polars "
"过滤缺省值并为学生、题目与知识点重新分配紧凑自增编号。"
msgstr ""
"**Clean & ID Mapping**: Use Polars in `data_process.py process` to filter"
" missing values and assign compact contiguous integer IDs to students, "
"questions, and skills."

#: ../../source/user-guides/data-pipeline.md:13
#: 6997a33664284b7aa3504d08a32b3b3f
msgid "**零泄露划分**：按学生总体答题量与正答率分层划分为 5 折，并独立保留 Held-out 测试集。"
msgstr ""
"**Zero-Leakage Splitting**: Stratifies all students into 5 folds based on"
" total interactions and accuracy, holding out an isolated test set."

#: ../../source/user-guides/data-pipeline.md:14
#: e7a37aab375c49d2afeee1301259f612
msgid "**序列截断与展开**：根据配置的序列长度限制进行滑窗切分或截断。"
msgstr ""
"**Sequence Slicing & Expansion**: Slices or truncates sequences according"
" to maximum length budgets."

#: ../../source/user-guides/data-pipeline.md:15
#: faf01786400946b99e5892275736cd54
msgid "**规范化落盘**：统一导出标准化 Parquet 数据表与 `metadata.json` 数据集统计元信息。"
msgstr ""
"**Standardized Export**: Serializes normalized Parquet tables and dataset"
" summary statistics in `metadata.json`."

#: ../../source/user-guides/data-pipeline.md:17
#: de872759d3394dff997557f59b4d7d6b
msgid "1. 下载原始数据"
msgstr "1\\. Download Raw Data"

#: ../../source/user-guides/data-pipeline.md:19
#: 0f3eecd63ab54af6b315658fee9c30d8
msgid ""
"# 下载指定数据集，自动解压至 data/<dataset>/raw/\n"
"python data_process.py download -d assistments09\n"
"\n"
"# 强制重新下载，覆盖本地已有 raw 缓存\n"
"python data_process.py download -d assistments09 --force true\n"
"\n"
"# 指定并发下载线程数\n"
"python data_process.py download -d assistments09 --num_threads 8\n"
msgstr ""
"# Download the specified dataset and extract it to data/<dataset>/raw/\n"
"python data_process.py download -d assistments09\n"
"\n"
"# Force a fresh download that overwrites the local raw cache\n"
"python data_process.py download -d assistments09 --force true\n"
"\n"
"# Set the number of concurrent download threads\n"
"python data_process.py download -d assistments09 --num_threads 8"

#: ../../source/user-guides/data-pipeline.md:30
#: 651afba024b14f14a2815a79c4bf9179
msgid "2. 执行预处理流水线"
msgstr "2\\. Run Preprocessing Pipeline"

#: ../../source/user-guides/data-pipeline.md:32
#: f790c5e1807547bfb64a921798b39db7
msgid ""
"# 使用默认配置进行处理，采用 5 折交叉验证与默认序列长度范围\n"
"python data_process.py process -d assistments09\n"
"\n"
"# 自定义序列长度与折数\n"
"python data_process.py process -d assistments09 \\\n"
"    --data.min_seq_len 5 \\\n"
"    --data.max_seq_len 150 \\\n"
"    --data.kfold 5 \\\n"
"    --data.test_ratio 0.2\n"
"\n"
"# 启用 windowlate 滑窗特征增强\n"
"python data_process.py process -d assistments09 --extra windowlate\n"
msgstr ""
"# Run preprocessing with default settings (5-fold cross-validation and "
"default length range)\n"
"python data_process.py process -d assistments09\n"
"\n"
"# Custom sequence length bounds and fold count\n"
"python data_process.py process -d assistments09 \\\n"
"    --data.min_seq_len 5 \\\n"
"    --data.max_seq_len 150 \\\n"
"    --data.kfold 5 \\\n"
"    --data.test_ratio 0.2\n"
"\n"
"# Enable windowlate sliding window feature augmentation\n"
"python data_process.py process -d assistments09 --extra windowlate\n"

#: ../../source/user-guides/data-pipeline.md:49
#: f8f597da59374c9e87cf074e48a8f82b
msgid "产物目录与文件结构"
msgstr "Artifact Directory and File Structure"

#: ../../source/user-guides/data-pipeline.md:51
#: 7c7834ff59ed4d2eaa50d5182154eb27
msgid "预处理完成后，数据集目录（以 `data/assistments09/` 为例）包含以下标准文件："
msgstr ""
"Following preprocessing, dataset directories (e.g., "
"`data/assistments09/`) contain the following standardized files:"

#: ../../source/user-guides/data-pipeline.md:53
#: ffedf62cf4774c9dafb1b0734960db32
msgid ""
"data/assistments09/\n"
"├── raw/                                                # 下载并解压的原始 "
"CSV/TXT 文件\n"
"├── assistments09_sequence.parquet                      # 全局清洗后的学生交互完整时序表"
"\n"
"├── assistments09_split_question_sequence.parquet       # 题目级切片序列表 (供 "
"QuestionModelData 读取)\n"
"├── assistments09_split_skill_sequence.parquet          # 技能级切片序列表 (供 "
"SkillModelData 读取)\n"
"├── assistments09_relation_question_skill.parquet       # 题目-技能关联二部图关系表\n"
"├── assistments09_relation_question_assignment.parquet  # (可选) 题目-作业集合关联表"
"\n"
"├── assistments09_relation_question_template.parquet    # (可选) 题目-模板关联表\n"
"└── metadata.json                                       # 数据集元数据与文件哈希快照\n"
msgstr ""
"data/assistments09/\n"
"├── raw/                                                # Downloaded raw "
"CSV/TXT files\n"
"├── assistments09_sequence.parquet                      # Master cleaned "
"chronological interaction table\n"
"├── assistments09_split_question_sequence.parquet       # Question-level "
"sliced sequence table (for QuestionModelData)\n"
"├── assistments09_split_skill_sequence.parquet          # Skill-level "
"sliced sequence table (for SkillModelData)\n"
"├── assistments09_relation_question_skill.parquet       # Question-skill "
"bipartite graph table\n"
"├── assistments09_relation_question_assignment.parquet  # (Optional) "
"Question-assignment mapping table\n"
"├── assistments09_relation_question_template.parquet    # (Optional) "
"Question-template mapping table\n"
"└── metadata.json                                       # Dataset "
"metadata and file checksum snapshot\n"

