#: ../../source/user-guides/data-pipeline.md:86
#: 9f0628761fa24a0bba407b3e4f64ec51
msgid "2. 切片序列数据"
msgstr "2\\. Sliced Sequence Data"

#: ../../source/user-guides/data-pipeline.md:88
#: 5c2965ea586644a78f4ed8cbbf904365
msgid ""
"深度学习知识追踪模型通常无法直接处理极长的不规则序列（如数千步交互）。UniKT 会根据 `max_seq_len` "
"将每个长序列切分为固定预算的子序列："
msgstr ""
"Deep Knowledge Tracing models typically cannot process arbitrarily long "
"ragged sequences. UniKT slices lengthy histories into sub-sequences "
"within `max_seq_len` budgets:"

#: ../../source/user-guides/data-pipeline.md:90
#: c0cb20b0611a446cb3a95c2e52f78f4d
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**`{dataset}_split_question_sequence.parquet`**：用于题目级模型（如 "
"SimpleKTQ、AKT、DKT 等面向题目的实现）。一行对应一次题目交互，`skills` 保留为 `List(Int32)`。"
msgstr ""
"**`{dataset}_split_question_sequence.parquet`**: For question-level "
"models (e.g., SimpleKTQ, AKT, item-centric DKT). Each row corresponds to "
"a question attempt, preserving `skills` as `List(Int32)`."

#: ../../source/user-guides/data-pipeline.md:91
#: 8a4cb187702f40119592acac89db302b
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**`{dataset}_split_skill_sequence.parquet`**：用于技能级模型（如 DKT、DKVMN、GKT "
"等面向技能概念的模型）。若一道题关联多个技能，管线会在此表中展开为多行，并将 `skill` 投影为单值 `Int32`。"
msgstr ""
"**`{dataset}_split_skill_sequence.parquet`**: For skill-level models "
"(e.g., DKT, DKVMN, GKT). Multi-skill questions are expanded into multiple"
" rows with `skill` projected to scalar `Int32`."

#: ../../source/user-guides/data-pipeline.md:93
#: 0b542ddeb29e4409899238c9379b98d6
