msgstr "`sequence_id`"

#: ../../source/user-guides/data-pipeline.md b1480c5113504ad895828bb22b87cc8a
msgid "切片子序列的全局唯一标识符"
msgstr "Globally unique sliced sequence identifier"

#: ../../source/user-guides/data-pipeline.md 09f951adfd4e4e5ea97218e0550027b0
msgid "`seq_pos`"
msgstr "`seq_pos`"

#: ../../source/user-guides/data-pipeline.md 0bc9b638e82647269e72903f34705a77
msgid "该交互在当前子序列中的相对索引，从 `0` 到 `split_len - 1`"
msgstr ""
"Relative interaction index within current slice, from `0` to `split_len -"
" 1`"

#: ../../source/user-guides/data-pipeline.md a40ecfbde8c949a7be03da34202dc074
msgid "继承自对应学生的 `fold` 标签，确保切片后划分依然严谨对齐"
msgstr "Inherited `fold` label from student, ensuring leak-free partitioning"

#: ../../source/user-guides/data-pipeline.md:101
#: 8d99e6093313454bad39ebef92539cc6
msgid "3. 实体关系表"
msgstr "3\\. Entity Relation Tables"

#: ../../source/user-guides/data-pipeline.md:103
#: 1ec4fbc6d81e4de9a93814d2636611a0
msgid "用于构建图神经网络拓扑结构（如 GIKT, SGKT, HDHKT）或 Q 矩阵。最核心的关系表为 `question_skill`："
msgstr ""
"Used for constructing GNN graph topologies (e.g., GIKT, SGKT, HDHKT) or "
"Q-matrices. The primary relation table is `question_skill`:"

#: ../../source/user-guides/data-pipeline.md 0686209617994e24b41b8e212532f822
msgid "题目标识"
msgstr "Question identifier"

#: ../../source/user-guides/data-pipeline.md 91a26de03f1248e0979a2d036ef1f1a7
msgid "`skill`"
msgstr "`skill`"

#: ../../source/user-guides/data-pipeline.md cdb229580b85493a98d8739fd37df739
msgid "关联的技能概念标识"
msgstr "Associated skill concept identifier"

#: ../../source/user-guides/data-pipeline.md:112
#: 0f81f4f5b8ca4c05910454555a826547
msgid "序列截断与展开策略"
msgstr "Sequence Truncation and Expansion Strategies"

#: ../../source/user-guides/data-pipeline.md:114
#: 3ed0c34aa64c4288a15f57cfa537be92
msgid ""
"知识追踪领域的一大经典技术难点在于：**多技能题目在转换为技能序列时，截断应发生在 KC 展开前还是展开后？** UniKT 通过 "
"`--data.truncation_stage` 提供了显式控制："
msgstr ""
"A classic technical nuance in knowledge tracing is: **should multi-skill "
"items be truncated before or after skill expansion?** UniKT provides "
"explicit control via `--data.truncation_stage`:"

#: ../../source/user-guides/data-pipeline.md:116
#: 2f51c963070848bab726b21a2a6e005c
msgid "**`post_expansion`（默认，推荐）**："
msgstr "**`post_expansion` (Default, Recommended)**:"

#: ../../source/user-guides/data-pipeline.md:117
#: 0ef3104dcde44eb8a1c953f2b3522816
msgid "先对单次题目的多个技能进行行展开，然后再按 `max_seq_len` 进行切块截断。"
msgstr ""
"Expands multi-skill questions into separate rows first, then truncates "
"blocks by `max_seq_len`."

#: ../../source/user-guides/data-pipeline.md:118
#: 49f8cbf9cf01443b9020462178a13aa2
msgid ""
"**特点**：保证每个子序列中的技能行数绝对不超过 "
"`max_seq_len`，张量对齐简单；但在极少数情况下，同一道题关联的多个技能可能会被边界切开在两个相邻子序列中。"
msgstr ""
"**Characteristics**: Guarantees skill row count in each sub-sequence "
"never exceeds `max_seq_len`, simplifying tensor padding; rarely, skills "
"belonging to one question might split across slice boundaries."

#: ../../source/user-guides/data-pipeline.md:119
#: 755f3772a17b42da87849e669c5a575c
msgid "**`pre_expansion`**："
msgstr "**`pre_expansion`**:"

#: ../../source/user-guides/data-pipeline.md:120
#: 7dfd5d0d50364264911f5f39d4d00caa
msgid "先对题目的交互事件进行截断切块（每块最多 `max_seq_len` 次答题），再在块内展开技能。"
msgstr ""
"Truncates question interaction events into chunks first (at most "
"`max_seq_len` attempts per chunk), then expands skills within each chunk."

#: ../../source/user-guides/data-pipeline.md:121
#: aa1bc7ce67d9437381f952be5abb1b6a
msgid ""
"**特点**：保证同一道题的所有技能永远处于同一个子序列内；展开后的实际行数可能略大于 `max_seq_len`，框架运行时会自动根据 "
"`metadata.json` 中记录的真实最大长度动态适配张量。"
msgstr ""
"**Characteristics**: Ensures all skills of a question remain in the same "
"sub-sequence; expanded row counts may slightly exceed `max_seq_len`, "
"which the framework dynamically accommodates via the actual maximum "
"length in `metadata.json`."

#: ../../source/user-guides/data-pipeline.md:125
#: 3ee26e65d126472f8e6fbecf3aae7db4
msgid "数据集采样策略"
msgstr "Dataset Sampling Strategies"

#: ../../source/user-guides/data-pipeline.md:127
#: f601aad0697f4e7c97c29a35c54f93e6
msgid "对于超大规模数据集（如 EdNet 或 Junyi），UniKT 提供了内置采样逻辑，在不破坏统计分布的前提下加速原型开发："
msgstr ""
"For ultra-large datasets (such as EdNet or Junyi), UniKT provides built-"
"in sampling to accelerate prototyping without perturbing statistical "
"distributions:"

#: ../../source/user-guides/data-pipeline.md:129
#: fe13313db9e348e391ccf4f431fe1607
msgid ""
"# 1. 绝对数量采样：随机抽取 1,000 名学生及其全部答题历史\n"
"python data_process.py process -d junyi2015 --data.sample_size 1000 "
"--data.sample_strategy random\n"
"\n"
"# 2. 比例采样：抽取 10% 的学生\n"
"python data_process.py process -d ednet_kt1 --data.sample_ratio 0.1\n"
"\n"
"# 3. 分层采样：按作答量与答对率分箱保持分布一致性\n"
"python data_process.py process -d junyi2015 \\\n"
"    --data.sample_size 5000 \\\n"
"    --data.sample_strategy stratified \\\n"
"    --data.sample_attempts_bins [20, 100, 500] \\\n"
"    --data.sample_correct_bins [0.3, 0.7]\n"
msgstr ""
"# 1. Absolute count sampling: randomly draw 1,000 students and their full"
" interaction histories\n"
"python data_process.py process -d junyi2015 --data.sample_size 1000 "
"--data.sample_strategy random\n"
"\n"
"# 2. Ratio sampling: draw 10% of students\n"
"python data_process.py process -d ednet_kt1 --data.sample_ratio 0.1\n"
"\n"
"# 3. Stratified sampling: bin by attempts and accuracy to preserve "
"distributions\n"
"python data_process.py process -d junyi2015 \\\n"
"    --data.sample_size 5000 \\\n"
"    --data.sample_strategy stratified \\\n"
"    --data.sample_attempts_bins [20, 100, 500] \\\n"
"    --data.sample_correct_bins [0.3, 0.7]\n"

#: ../../source/user-guides/data-pipeline.md:146
